What is EMC Equipment and Instruments?
EMC Equipment and Instruments are essential for ensuring that electronic products meet global emission and immunity standards. These instruments enable manufacturers to detect unwanted radiated and conducted emissions, validate immunity against external fields, and verify that shielding solutions perform as intended. The portfolio spans high‑frequency signal generators for 5G‑compatible testing, reverberation chambers for comprehensive shielding evaluation, and portable ESD simulators for on‑site compliance checks.
